								<p class="0" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;"><br></span></p>
<p class="0" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;">2026</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕;">학년도 후기 대학원 외국인특별전형 모집요강(2차 모집)</span></p>
<div id="hwpEditorBoardContent" class="hwp_editor_board_content" data-hjsonver="1.0" data-jsonlen="5376"></div>
<p class="0" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕;"><br></span></p>
<p class="0" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕;">모집요강은 첨부파일을 확인해주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;">.</span></p>
<p class="0" style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="0" style="text-align: center;"><br></p>
<p class="0" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">★&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">입학지원서 온라인 작성 및 제출 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[2026. 6. 1.(</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">월</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">) 10:00 ~ 2026. 7. 10.(</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">금</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">) 17:00]</span></span></p>
<p class="0" style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
